WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.909
Whether you're new to international shipping or you're a seasoned expert, it's

00:00:04.909 --> 00:00:09.000
good to consider how you'll ship and fulfill international orders.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.667
In this

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:13.667
step, you'll learn the different ways Amazon can help with shipping globally.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.000
Let's explore your options.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
One, you can ship and fulfill yourself.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.588
Two, you can

00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:26.412
enlist Amazon services to take care of inbounding, exporting, and other

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:28.000
international fulfillment operations.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Or three, you can do a combination of both.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
You ship and fulfill some products, and Amazon ships and fulfills some.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.500
Amazon's fulfillment services make managing international sales easier, and

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.000
our global fulfillment networks ensure customers receive products quickly.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.400
Also,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.800
FBA works similarly in all of Amazon's global marketplaces, where products

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.500
fulfilled by Amazon are generally eligible for prime, and thus more appealing to

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.000
prime customers around the world.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.231
Wave goodbye to complex global processes and

00:01:00.231 --> 00:01:03.000
say hello to convenient global shipping.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.250
It's time to set sail with the help of

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.000
Amazon global selling.
